{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53934","headline":"五言美瓜沙僧献款诗一首 · 圆鉴","name":"五言美瓜沙僧献款诗一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主恩方洽，瓜沙有异僧。\n身中多种艺，心地几千灯。\n面进输诚款，亲论向化能。\n诏迥（疑应作「回」）应锡赉，殊宠一层层。\n（同前，又见伯三七二○卷。\n原署：「右街千福寺内道场应制大德圆鉴」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"圆鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}